WEBVTT

00:22:28.529 --> 00:22:32.640
How big is this?
And what do we need to do?

00:22:32.664 --> 00:22:35.014
There was nothing coming in.
It was all going out.

00:22:35.038 --> 00:22:36.946
But we still had these hotel rooms.

00:22:36.970 --> 00:22:39.136
AG: That's when Hilton
came up with a plan.

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:42.276
They would do what they do best:
offer hospitality.

00:22:42.300 --> 00:22:45.356
CH: Hospitality is caring for others

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:48.016
and spreading light and warmth.

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:51.255
AG: In partnership with American Express
and its hotel owners,

00:22:51.279 --> 00:22:54.336
Hilton donated a million
rooms across the US

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:56.667
to frontline healthcare professionals.

00:22:56.691 --> 00:22:59.626
CH: For us to be able
to provide accommodations

00:22:59.650 --> 00:23:02.265
for people who are literally
working on the front lines